title: The Church, School and Secular State Settlement
subtitle: Begin with concordat renegotiation; catechism funding is a fallback settlement, not a first rung.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_major_reform_card
frequency: 130
view-if: month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_church_reform_timer <= 0 and church_reform_settled = 0 and church_on_slate = 1 and reform_pressure_pending = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.poland_church_reform_timer = 3;
Q.church_reform_next_stage = Number(Q.church_reform_proposal_stage) || 4;
const thresholds = [0, 26, 42, 60, 84];
Q.church_reform_threshold = thresholds[Q.church_reform_next_stage];
const ministryBonus =
    (Q.family_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 8 : 0) +
    (Q.science_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 7 : 0) +
    (Q.finance_minister_party == "Lewica" ? 4 : 0);
const koCabinet = Q.government_party == "ko" || Q.ministry_ko_in_cabinet;
const pslCabinet = Q.government_party == "psl" || Q.ministry_psl_in_cabinet;
const p2050Cabinet =
    Q.government_party == "p2050" || Q.ministry_p2050_in_cabinet;
const thirdWayCabinet = pslCabinet || p2050Cabinet;
let partnerBonus = 0;
if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
    partnerBonus =
        Number(Q.pis_relation) * 0.10 +
        Number(Q.church_pis_commitment) * 6 -
        30;
} else {
    partnerBonus =
        (koCabinet
            ? Number(Q.ko_relation) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.ko_accept_rights) * 0.10 +
                Number(Q.church_ko_commitment) * 6
            : 0) +
        (thirdWayCabinet
            ? Number(Q.church_third_way_commitment) * 5 -
                (pslCabinet ? Number(Q.psl_conservative_share) * 0.12 : 0) -
                (p2050Cabinet
                    ? Number(Q.p2050_christian_dem_share) * 0.08
                    : 0)
            : 0);
}
const palaceBonus =
    Number(Q.president_relation) * 0.06 +
    (Q.church_palace_president == Q.president_name
        ? Number(Q.church_palace_commitment) * 6
        : 0);
const publicBonus =
    (Number(Q.secular_state_support) - 40) * 0.40 +
    Number(Q.anticlerical_edge) * 0.10 +
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_poll) - 5) * 0.50 -
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.secular_state_backlash) - 55) * 0.14;
Q.church_reform_power = Math.round(Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        140,
        Number(Q.church_reform_progress) * 0.62 +
        partnerBonus + palaceBonus + publicBonus + ministryBonus +
        (Q.church_referendum_mandate ? 18 : 0) -
        Number(Q.eu_progressive_headwind)
    )
));
Q.reform_ceiling_issue = "church";
Q.reform_ceiling_target = Q.church_reform_next_stage;
!}
call: poland_reform_ceiling
card-image: img/poland/cards/group-equality.webp

= The concordat as a whole-game project

**Campaign goal:** [? if church_reform_defined: [+ church_reform_goal_label
+].?][? if not church_reform_defined: Not yet defined.?]
[? if church_reform_defined: **Bill currently on the table:** [+
church_reform_next_label +].
**Passage power:** **[+ church_reform_power +]**; tabling this bill needs **[+
church_reform_threshold +]**.
**Settlement ceiling:** [+ reform_ceiling_tier_label +] — [+
reform_ceiling_reachable_label +].
[? if reform_ceiling_blocker_kind != "none": Binding veto player: **[+
reform_ceiling_blocker_name +]** — scores the bill [+
reform_ceiling_blocker_score +] against the [+ reform_ceiling_need +] a tier-[+
reform_ceiling_target_resolved +] settlement needs.?]
[+ reform_ceiling_breakdown +].?][? if not church_reform_defined: The first
project action must define the ambitious bill before preparation or bargaining
can begin.?]

The concordat is a treaty, the Church Fund is a budget line and catechism is a
timetable decision. They can be settled separately, and a partner that will
move the timetable will not always touch the treaty.

[? if secular_state_support >= 55: Public opinion has moved on this. The
argument for religion out of the school day now has a majority behind it, and
partners who used to call the issue marginal have to explain a position rather
than a reflex.?][? if secular_state_support < 45: The country is not with us on
this yet. Church privilege remains defensible in public, and every partner
knows it.?]

[? if government_party = "pis": A PiS-led cabinet will not touch the concordat.
The most that shared government can produce here is a budget technicality.?][? if government_party != "pis": PSL's conservative wing and Poland 2050's
Christian democrats treat the concordat as settled constitutional furniture. KO
is more willing on schools than on the treaty.?]

- @define_goal
- @draft
- @coalition_round
- @cash_relation
- @ministry
- @palace
- @referendum
- @advance

@define_goal
title: Define the goal as concordat renegotiation and a secular state
subtitle: The treaty, the Church Fund and religion in schools enter as one opening demand.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 0
on-arrival: church_reform_defined = 1; church_on_slate = 1; church_reform_goal_stage = 4; church_reform_proposal_stage = 4; church_reform_next_stage = 4; church_reform_progress += 12; progressive_credibility += 2; anticlerical_edge += 4; news_headline = "Lewica defines concordat renegotiation as its secular-state bill"

Naming the treaty as the target means no one can later present a moved
catechism hour as the whole programme.

- #poland_card_finish

@draft
title: Keep the canon lawyers and school inspectors drafting
subtitle: Free. Preparation +10.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: church_reform_progress += 10; public_mood_pending_secular_state_salience += 2; news_headline = "Lewica keeps its secular-state statute ready for the next opening"

Treaty lawyers, education inspectors and the Church Fund's own accounts turn a
slogan into clauses with costs attached.

- #poland_card_finish

@coalition_round
title: Put the secular-state file on a partner's table
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Choose KO, [+ third_way_display_name +] or PiS and record one commitment.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A serious negotiating round needs one resource.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @round_ko
- @round_third_way
- @round_pis

@round_ko
title: Ask KO to record a school and Church Fund floor
on-arrival: resources -= 1; church_reform_progress += 8; church_ko_commitment += 1; ko_relation += 4; news_headline = "KO records a secular-schools floor for the coalition agreement"

- #poland_card_finish

@round_third_way
title: Make [+ third_way_display_name +] name the clerical privilege it would end
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.resources -= 1; Q.church_reform_progress += 8; Q.church_third_way_commitment += 1; Q.psl_relation += 3; Q.p2050_relation += 3; Q.news_headline = Q.third_way_display_name + " records a limited secular-state compromise"; !}

- #poland_card_finish

@round_pis
title: Open a Church Fund audit channel with PiS
choose-if: (left_in_government = 1 and government_party = "pis") or pis_relation >= 20 or national_crisis_pressure >= 25
unavailable-subtitle: PiS will not discuss clerical finances without coalition ties or national pressure.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; church_reform_progress += 6; church_pis_commitment += 1; pis_relation += 3; news_headline = "PiS accepts an audit channel on clerical finances"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_relation
title: Cash in a party relationship instead of spending a resource
subtitle: Choose a 58+ relationship; it falls by 12 and becomes one recorded commitment.
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58 or pis_relation >= 58 or ((p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1) and (psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58))
unavailable-subtitle: No potential governing partner trusts us enough yet.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
new-page: true

- @cash_ko
- @cash_third_way
- @cash_pis

@cash_ko
title: Spend KO goodwill on the secular-state bill
choose-if: ko_relation >= 58
on-arrival: ko_relation -= 12; church_ko_commitment += 1; church_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts KO goodwill into a secular-state commitment"

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_third_way
title: Spend [+ third_way_display_name +] goodwill on a limited compromise
view-if: p2050_emerged = 1 or third_way_active = 1
choose-if: psl_relation >= 58 or p2050_relation >= 58
on-arrival: {!
if (Number(Q.psl_relation) >= Number(Q.p2050_relation)) {
    Q.psl_relation -= 12;
} else {
    Q.p2050_relation -= 12;
}
Q.church_third_way_commitment += 1;
Q.church_reform_progress += 10;
Q.news_headline = "Lewica converts " + Q.third_way_display_name + " goodwill into a clerical-finance compromise";
!}

- #poland_card_finish

@cash_pis
title: Spend PiS goodwill on a Church Fund audit
choose-if: pis_relation >= 58
on-arrival: pis_relation -= 12; church_pis_commitment += 1; church_reform_progress += 10; news_headline = "Lewica converts PiS goodwill into a clerical-finance audit"

- #poland_card_finish

@ministry
title: Make the ministries produce the timetable and funding file
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Preparation +14.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and budget >= 1 and (family_minister_party = "Lewica" or science_minister_party = "Lewica")
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Family or Science portfolio and one budget point.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; church_reform_progress += 14; administrative_capacity += 2; government_delivery += 1; news_headline = "The ministries map catechism hours, grades and Church Fund transfers"

Every school and every transfer receives a date and a number. Partners can vote
no, but not on the grounds that the consequences are unknowable.

- #poland_card_finish

@palace
title: Put the treaty and school file before the President
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Presidential commitment +1; preparation +6.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace delegation needs one resource.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Q.church_palace_president != Q.president_name) {
    Q.church_palace_commitment = 0;
    Q.church_palace_president = Q.president_name;
}
Q.church_palace_commitment += 1;
Q.church_reform_progress += 6;
Q.president_relation += 3;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace receives the concordat and school-timetable file";
!}

A President who intends to veto now has to name the clause. That is not the
same as a signature, and on a treaty question most Palaces have a hard limit
well below our goal.

- #poland_card_finish

@referendum
title: Ask the country about religion in schools
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Hard referendum route; preparation, public support and Left polling all count.
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and resources >= 1 and church_reform_progress >= 30 and secular_state_support >= 50 and church_referendum_mandate = 0
unavailable-subtitle: Requires governing authority, one resource, 30 preparation and majority public support.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
const variation =
    Math.floor((this.random.uint32() / 4294967296) * 11) - 5;
Q.church_referendum_score = Math.round(
    18 + Number(Q.secular_state_support) * 0.45 +
    Number(Q.left_poll) * 0.50 +
    Number(Q.church_reform_progress) * 0.15 -
    Number(Q.secular_state_backlash) * 0.18 +
    (Number(Q.church_ko_commitment) +
        Number(Q.church_pis_commitment) +
        Number(Q.church_third_way_commitment)) * 2 +
    variation
);
if (Q.church_referendum_score >= 50) {
    Q.church_referendum_mandate = 1;
    Q.church_reform_progress += 12;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 4;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += 8;
    Q.church_referendum_result = "A majority endorsed the reform mandate";
    Q.news_headline = "A national vote backs religion leaving the school day";
} else {
    Q.church_reform_progress = Math.max(
        Number(Q.church_reform_stage) * 20,
        Number(Q.church_reform_progress) - 8
    );
    Q.church_reform_proposal_stage =
        Number(Q.church_reform_goal_stage) || 4;
    Q.poland_church_reform_timer = 6;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
    Q.public_mood_pending_secular_state_backlash += 6;
    Q.church_referendum_result = "The reform mandate fell short";
    Q.news_headline = "The secular-state referendum campaign falls short";
}
!}
go-to: referendum_result

@referendum_result
title: The referendum count
new-page: true

**Campaign score: [+ church_referendum_score +].** [+
church_referendum_result +].

[? if church_referendum_mandate: The mandate is worth twelve points against
every veto player's resistance. It is not a signature and it does not amend the
concordat.?][? if not church_referendum_mandate: The defeat hardens the
backlash and forces a six-month regroup. The goal and the drafting work
survive.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@advance
title: Table the bill: [+ church_reform_next_label +]
subtitle: Requires government and passage power at or above the displayed threshold; veto players may force a narrower final settlement.
view-if: church_reform_defined = 1
choose-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and church_reform_power >= church_reform_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: We either lack executive access or have not assembled enough coalition, public and presidential power.
on-arrival: reform_pressure_issue = "church"; reform_pressure_target_stage = church_reform_proposal_stage; reform_pressure_previous_stage = 0; reform_pressure_return_mode = "card"; reform_pressure_palace_override = 0; reform_pressure_referendum_used = 0
go-to: poland_major_reforms.resolve
